> Velobiotics (Pty) Ltd is a South African probiotic company. Every Velobiotics product uses patented microencapsulation: a micro-shield formed around each individual bacterium (not around the capsule) so live probiotics survive stomach acid, heat and shelf storage and reach the gut alive. Products are supplements that support gut, immune, intimate and everyday wellness; they do not treat, cure or prevent disease. Prices in ZAR. Single support mailbox: support@velobiotics.com.

